        "text": "Safety isn’t a milestone. It’s a habit, practiced every hour. \nOur Eastern Sector projects have been recognized by the National Water Company for reaching 30 million safe man-hours, strengthening safety standards and delivering on performance targets. \n\nEvery one of those hours was worked by teams who put people first. \n\n#SafetyFirst #HSE #EasternProvince #AWPT",
